.TH AIRUNNER-HEADLESS 1 "October 2026" "airunner 6.1.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
airunner-headless \- Headless AI Runner daemon supervisor.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B airunner-headless
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B airunner-headless
is the headless AI Runner daemon supervisor for eval testing and API
access. The
.BR airunner-headless.service (8)
systemd unit runs this command; see
.BR journalctl (1)
for its logs.
.PP
This is the services-only package: it contains no Qt desktop client.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/airunner/daemon.yaml
Daemon configuration, seeded from the packaged example on first install.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR airunner-daemon (1),
.BR airunner-service (1),
https://github.com/Capsize-Games/airunner
